decisions.rule:
dytallix-staging-2 is retired and not restarted. Its records and snapshots are kept. Staging comes back as dytallix-staging-3:
- a release built from main with #134, #136, #137 and #138;
- every bundle sealed again, so the signing guard ships in host_install.py;
- a new genesis;
- both hosts reinstalled.
The validator recovery drill runs again there, with the signing guard and the start gate.
